WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Mira Tan>Thanks for making time. How are invoices going since you switched?</v>

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Dana Holt>Sending them is fine now. Getting paid is the problem. I spend every Friday morning chasing late invoices by email.</v>

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Mira Tan>How many are late in a normal month?</v>

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Dana Holt>Out of thirty, maybe eight. And each one is an awkward money conversation with a client we want to keep.</v>

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Mira Tan>Do you use the reminder feature?</v>

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
<v Dana Holt>I turned it off. It sends the same cold text to everyone. A client of five years got the same message as a one-off job.</v>

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
<v Mira Tan>What would you want instead?</v>

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:06.000
<v Dana Holt>Reminders I can write per client, in my voice. Friendly for the regulars, firm for the ones who always pay sixty days late.</v>

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
<v Mira Tan>Anything else on your list?</v>

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:25.000
<v Dana Holt>We bill two clients in dollars and one in Swiss francs. I still do those invoices in a spreadsheet because the VAT line comes out wrong.</v>
